ext-[#171513]\">Studio Location:</p><p>Dr. B. A. Road, Parel, Mumbai, Maharashtra</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2\"><a href=\"tel:919920086695\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 py-3 px-4 bg-white/50 text-[#171513] border border-white/70 rounded-2xl text-xs font-medium hover:bg-white/80 transition-colors shadow-xs\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#9d8766]\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg><span>Call Now</span></a><a href=\"https://wa.me/919920086695?text=Hello%20KRM%20Interior%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20inquire%20about%20interior%20design%20services.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 py-3 px-4 bg-[#171513] text-[#faf9f6] rounded-2xl text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-[#343029] transition-colors shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#d6caa7]\"><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg><span>WhatsApp</span></a></div></div></div><section id=\"top\" class=\"relative w-full h-[320vh] bg-[#faf9f6]\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 w-full h-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_65%_50%,#f0ebe0_0%,#faf9f6_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none grid-lines opacity-20\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-30 bg-[#faf9f6] flex flex-col items-center justify-center transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none opacity-100\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-xs px-6 text-center space-y-4\"><span class=\"font-serif text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-[#171513]\">KRM Interior</span><div class=\"w-full bg-[#eae4d7] h-0.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-[#9d8766] h-full transition-all duration-200 ease-out\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div><p class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#7a7266]\">Loading Spatial Experience • <!-- -->0<!-- -->%</p></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-full max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center\"><div class=\"absolute bottom-[20%] right-[20%] sm:right-[30%] w-72 sm:w-96 h-12 bg-black/5 rounded-full filter blur-2xl transform scale-y-50 pointer-events-none\"></div><canvas class=\"w-full h-full object-contain pointer-events-none\" style=\"image-rendering:-webkit-optimize-contrast\"></canvas></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-5 sm:px-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-700 transform opacity-100 translate-y-0 pointer-events-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-xl space-y-5\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-light tracking-tight text-[#171513] leading-[1.08] text-balance\">Spaces Designed <br/><span class=\"italic font-normal text-[#8c795b]\">Around You.</span></h1><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-[#5c5447] max-w-lg leading-relaxed font-normal\">Thoughtfully designed interiors that bring together architecture, functionality and refined aesthetics. Specializing in bespoke residential and commercial spaces across Mumbai.</p><div class=\"pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-2.5 px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#171513] text-[#faf9f6] hover:bg-[#38332b] text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-medium transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg group\" href=\"#contact\"><span>Start Your Project</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform text-[#d6caa7]\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#f4f1ea]/90 hover:bg-[#eae4d7] text-[#2c2822] text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-medium transition-all border border-[#ded5c2]\" href=\"#showcase\"><span>Explore Our Work</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"relative py-28 md:py-36 bg-[#fbfaf8] border-t border-[#eae4d7] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 relative z-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center mb-24\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 space-y-6\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#9d8766] font-semibold\"><span>01</span><span>•</span><span>Studio Ethos</span></div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[#171513] font-light leading-[1.12] text-balance\">Interiors with Intention. <br/><span class=\"italic font-normal text-[#8c795b]\">Form follows life.</span></h2><p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-[#524a3e] leading-relaxed font-light\">At KRM Interior, we approach every interior not as a blank canvas to decorate, but as an architectural volume to orchestrate. We balance sculptural simplicity, acoustic tranquility, and human-centric utility to create homes and workplaces that endure.</p><div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center space-x-6\"><a href=\"#services\" class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#171513] hover:text-[#9d8766] font-semibold transition-colors group\"><span>Discover Our Disciplines</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right w-3.5 h-3.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform text-[#9d8766]\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#ded5c2]\"></span><span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-[#7a7266]\">Parel, Mumbai</span></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 relative\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#ded5c2]\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210492486-724fe5c67fb0?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Architectural living interior with sunlight and warm minimalist furniture\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#141210]/60 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 text-white space-y-1\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#d6caa7]\">Atmospheric Balance</span><p class=\"font-serif text-lg font-light text-[#faf9f6]\">Natural light ingress &amp; natural lime plaster</p></div></div><div class=\"hidden sm:block absolute -bottom-8 -left-8 w-44 h-44 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border-4 border-[#faf9f6]\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Tactile timber and stone detail\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"/></div></div></div><section id=\"about\" class=\"relative overflo