] font-medium text-[#2d2821]\">White Statuario Quartz, Fluted Walnut, Tactile Bouclé Linens</p></div></div></div><div class=\"group bg-[#fbfaf8] hover:bg-white rounded-3xl border border-[#e5ded0] hover:border-[#cfc4b0] overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] bg-[#eae4d7] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566752355-35792bedcfea?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Nariman Point Private Executive Suite\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-106\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 z-10 flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#ded5c4] text-[10px] font-mono text-[#4a4338] shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3 h-3 text-[#9d8766]\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>South Mumbai</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 z-10 flex items-center space-x-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#ded5c4] text-[10px] font-mono text-[#4a4338] shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 w-3 h-3 text-[#8c795b]\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg><span>2,100 sq.ft.</span></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 z-10 flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#ded5c4] shadow-sm\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#736a5c] uppercase tracking-wider pl-1\">Palette</span><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1.5\"><span class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-black/10 shadow-inner\" style=\"background-color:#ece6db\" title=\"#ece6db\"></span><span class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-black/10 shadow-inner\" style=\"background-color:#b5a895\" title=\"#b5a895\"></span><span class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-black/10 shadow-inner\" style=\"background-color:#5c5345\" title=\"#5c5345\"></span><span class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-black/10 shadow-inner\" style=\"background-color:#1c1a17\" title=\"#1c1a17\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"p-7 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4\"><div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#9d8766] font-semibold mb-1.5\">Commercial Concept</div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#171513] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#8c795b] transition-colors leading-snug\">Nariman Point Private Executive Suite</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#5c5447] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\">Discreet acoustic isolation, concealed presentation technology, and architectural lighting engineered for high-level governance.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-[#eae4d7] space-y-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8a8070]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers w-3 h-3 text-[#9d8766]\"><path d=\"m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z\"></path><path d=\"m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65\"></path><path d=\"m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65\"></path></svg><span>Materiality Specification:</span></div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#2d2821]\">Smoked Grey Veneer, Anodized Titanium Accents, Silk-Wool Rugs</p></div></div></div><div class=\"group bg-[#fbfaf8] hover:bg-white rounded-3xl border border-[#e5ded0] hover:border-[#cfc4b0] overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] bg-[#eae4d7] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585152220-90363fe7e115?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Prabhadevi Architectural Kitchen Study\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-106\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 z-10 flex items-center space-x-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#ded5c4] text-[10px] font-mono text-[#4a4338] shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-3 h-3 text-[#9d8766]\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>Prabhadevi, Mumbai</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 z-10 flex items-center space-x-1 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#ded5c4] text-[10px] font-mono text-[#4a4338] shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 w-3 h-3 text-[#8c795b]\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg><span>650 sq.ft.</span></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 z-10 flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-[#ded5c4] shadow-sm\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#736a5c] uppercase tracking-wider pl-1\">Palette</span><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1.5\"><span class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-black/10 shadow-inner\" style=\"background-color:#fbf9f5\" title=\"#fbf9f5\"></span><span class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-black/10 shadow-inner\" style=\"background-color:#e5decf\" title=\"#e5decf\"></span><span class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-black/10 shadow-inner\" style=\"background-color:#a49681\" title=\"#a49681\"></span><span class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border border-black/10 shadow-inner\" style=\"background-color:#22201c\" title=\"#22201c\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"p-7 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4\"><div><div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#9d8766] font-semibold mb-1.5\">Bespoke Millwork</div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#171513] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#8c795b] transition-colors leading-snug\">Prabhadevi Architectural Kitchen Study</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#5c5447] leading-relaxed line-clamp-3\">Zero-handle pocket door cabinetry, concealed appliance banks, and cantilevered quartzite breakfast bar.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-[#eae4d7] space-y-1.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8a8070]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers w-3 h-3 text-[#9d8766]\"><path d=\"m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z\"></path><path d=\"m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65\"></path><path d=\"m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65\"></path></svg><span>Materiality Specification:</span></div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#2d2821]\">Brazilian Quartzite, Matte Anti-Fingerprint Laminate, LED Strips</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"philosophy\" class=\"py-28 md:py-36 bg-[#f4f1ea] border-t border-[#eae4d7]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mb-16 md:mb-24\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#9d8766] font-semibold mb-3\"><span>04</span><span>•</span><span>Design Philosophy</span></div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[#171513] font-light leading-[1.12] mb-6\">The Five Constants. <br/><span class=\"italic font-normal text-[#8c795b]\">Guiding every decision.</span></h2><p class=\"text-base text-[#5c5447] leading-relaxed font-light\">Regardless of project scale or aesthetic direction, our studio evaluates every line drawn against five enduring architectural fundamentals.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"container mx-auto lg:py-2 2xl:max-w-[1400px]\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"col-span-12 sm:col-span-7 md:col-span-8 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-3\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl focus:outline-none\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[12/7] overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154526-990dced4db0d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"SPACE\" class=\" h-full w-full rounded-xl object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-105 group-focus:scale-105 \"/><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 p-2 sm:p-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-[#f4f1ea]/90 p-4 font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"text-sm md:text-xl\">SPACE</div></div></div><div class=\"text-xs text-white absolute top-3 right-3 w-8/12\">Optimized axial alignments, uncluttered visual horizons, and deliberate breathing room.</div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-span-12 sm:col-span-5 md:col-span-4\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl focus:outline-none\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[12/7] overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221195710-dd6b41faaea6?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"MATERIAL\" class=\" h-full w-full rounded-xl object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-105 group-focus:scale-105 \"/><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 p-2 sm:p-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-[#f4f1ea]/90 p-4 font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"text-sm md:text-xl\">MATERIAL</div></div></div><div class=\"text-xs text-white absolute top-3 right-3 w-8/12\">Natural stone veining, grain alignment, non-toxic acoustic textiles, and honed unlacquered metals.</div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-4\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl focus:outline-none\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[12/7] overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513694203232-719a280e022f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"LIGHT\" class=\" h-full w-full rounded-xl object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-105 group-focus:scale-105 \"/><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 p-2 sm:p-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-[#f4f1ea]/90 p-4 font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"text-sm md:text-xl\">LIGHT</div></div></div><div class=\"text-xs text-white absolute top-3 right-3 w-8/12\">2700K ambient warmth, architectural coves, glare-shielded downlights, and custom statement pendants.</div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-span-12 sm:col-span-5 md:col-span-4 lg:col-span-3\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl focus:outline-none\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[12/7] overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600573472550-8090b5e0745e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"FUNCTION\" class=\" h-full w-full rounded-xl object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-105 group-focus:scale-105 \"/><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 p-2 sm:p-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-[#f4f1ea]/90 p-4 font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"text-sm md:text-xl\">FUNCTION</div></div></div><div class=\"text-xs text-white absolute top-3 right-3 w-8/12\">Silent soft-close hardware, concealed HVAC diffuser slots, cable-free living zones, and purpose-built cabinetry.</div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-span-12 sm:col-span-6 md:col-span-5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-xl focus:outline-none\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[12/7] overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616046229478-9901c5536a45?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"DETAIL\" class=\" h-full w-full rounded-xl object-cover transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:scale-105 group-focus:scale-105 \"/><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 p-2 sm:p-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-[#f4f1ea]/90 p-4 font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"text-sm md:text-xl\">DETAIL</div></div></div><div class=\"text-xs text-white absolute top-3 right-3 w-8/12\">Precision reveals, bespoke joinery profiles, recessed floor skirting, and calibrated alignment.</div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"py-28 md:py-36 bg-[#faf9f6] border-t border-[#eae4d7]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-16 md:mb-24 gap-6\"><div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#9d8766] font-semibold mb-3\"><span>05</span><span>•</span><span>Methodology &amp; Workflow</span></div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[#171513] font-light leading-[1.12]\">Disciplined Process. <br/><span class=\"italic font-normal text-[#8c795b]\">From blueprint to living space.</span></h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5c5447] max-w-md leading-relaxed\">A transparent four-phase framework ensuring clarity, timeline discipline, and impeccable craft execution for every project in Mumbai.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"group relative rounded-3xl bg-[#fbfaf8] hover:bg-white border border-[#e5ded0] hover:border-[#9d8766] transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-[#eae4d7]\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503387762-592deb58ef4e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Understanding Space, Requirements &amp; Lifestyle\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-108\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex items-center space-x-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-sm text-[#8c795b] shadow-sm\">01<!-- --> — <!-- -->DISCOVER</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black/40 text-white backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#d6caa7]\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl font-medium text-[#171513] mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-[#8c795b] transition-colors\">Understanding Space, Requirements &amp; Lifestyle</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#61584b] leading-relaxed mb-6\">Every project begins with deep listening and site reconnaissance. We analyze natural light trajectories, existing structural parameters, civil layouts, and personal daily rituals in Mumbai.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-[#e2dacf] space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8a8070] block font-semibold\">Key Deliverables:</span><ul class=\"space-y-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Site Survey &amp; Dimension Verification</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Client Lifestyle Briefing</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Spatial Feasibility Review</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Budget &amp; Timeline Alignment</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"group relative rounded-3xl bg-[#fbfaf8] hover:bg-white border border-[#e5ded0] hover:border-[#9d8766] transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-[#eae4d7]\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Developing Visual &amp; Functional Direction\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-108\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex items-center space-x-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-sm text-[#8c795b] shadow-sm\">02<!-- --> — <!-- -->CONCEPT</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black/40 text-white backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#d6caa7]\"><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl font-medium text-[#171513] mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-[#8c795b] transition-colors\">Developing Visual &amp; Functional Direction</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#61584b] leading-relaxed mb-6\">We translate aspirations into architectural space. We explore volumetric flow, preliminary mood palettes, circulation options, and spatial zoning to establish a clear creative trajectory.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-[#e2dacf] space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8a8070] block font-semibold\">Key Deliverables:</span><ul class=\"space-y-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>2D Architectural Floor Plans</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Moodboard &amp; Material Swatch Concept</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Zoning Diagrams</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Design Trajectory Alignment</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"group relative rounded-3xl bg-[#fbfaf8] hover:bg-white border border-[#e5ded0] hover:border-[#9d8766] transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-[#eae4d7]\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618221381711-42ca8ab6e908?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Refining Materials, Layouts, Lighting &amp; Details\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-108\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex items-center space-x-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-sm text-[#8c795b] shadow-sm\">03<!-- --> — <!-- -->DESIGN</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black/40 text-white backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#d6caa7]\"><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl font-medium text-[#171513] mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-[#8c795b] transition-colors\">Refining Materials, Layouts, Lighting &amp; Details</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#61584b] leading-relaxed mb-6\">The concept is engineered into millimeter precision. We detail custom joinery, specify exact stone and timber finishes, engineer electrical and lighting schedules, and model full 3D spatial renders.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-[#e2dacf] space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8a8070] block font-semibold\">Key Deliverables:</span><ul class=\"space-y-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Photorealistic 3D Visualizations</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Comprehensive Millwork Shop Drawings</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Lighting &amp; Electrical Layout Schedules</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Final Material Specs &amp; BOQ</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"group relative rounded-3xl bg-[#fbfaf8] hover:bg-white border border-[#e5ded0] hover:border-[#9d8766] transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-[#eae4d7]\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Turning Approved Design into Finished Space\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-108\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 flex items-center space-x-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#faf9f6]/95 backdrop-blur-sm text-[#8c795b] shadow-sm\">04<!-- --> — <!-- -->EXECUTE</span></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black/40 text-white backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wrench w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#d6caa7]\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl font-medium text-[#171513] mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-[#8c795b] transition-colors\">Turning Approved Design into Finished Space</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#61584b] leading-relaxed mb-6\">Our skilled craftsmen, civil supervisors, and specialist fabricators bring the blueprints into physical reality under rigorous on-site quality controls and structured milestones.</p></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-[#e2dacf] space-y-2\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8a8070] block font-semibold\">Key Deliverables:</span><ul class=\"space-y-1.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>On-Site Civil &amp; MEP Supervision</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Artisanal Carpentry &amp; Joinery Fabrication</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Rigorous Snagging &amp; Finishing Audits</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] text-[#4d4538]\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-[#9d8766] shrink-0\"></span><span>Pristine Handover &amp; Walkthrough</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-28 md:py-36 bg-[#fbfaf8] border-t border-[#eae4d7]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 space-y-8\"><div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#9d8766] font-semibold mb-3\"><span>06</span><span>•</span><span>Get In Touch</span></div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-[#171513] font-light leading-[1.12] mb-4\">Let’s Design <br/><span class=\"italic font-normal text-[#8c795b]\">Your Space.</span></h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-[#5c5447] leading-relaxed\">Have a space in mind? Let’s discuss how it can be transformed with thoughtful architectural precision.</p></div><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/9] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-[#e4dcce]\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687939-ce8a6c25118c?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1000&amp;q=80\" alt=\"KRM Interior design studio consultations\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-transparent to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-white\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#d6caa7]\">Consultation Atelier</span><p class=\"font-serif text-base font-normal\">Parel Studio • Dr. B. A. Road, Mumbai</p></div></div><div class=\"p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#f5f2ea] border border-[#e4dcce] space-y-6\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-xl font-medium text-[#171513]\">KRM Interior Studio</h3><div class=\"space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4538]\"><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-3.5\"><div class=\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-[#ede7dc] text-[#8c795b] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><div><strong class=\"block text-[#171513] font-medium font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5\">Studio Address</strong><p class=\"leading-relaxed\">Dr. B. A. Road, Parel, Mumbai, Maharashtra</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-3.5\"><div class=\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-[#ede7dc] text-[#8c795b] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone w-4 h-4\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg></div><div><strong class=\"block text-[#171513] font-medium font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5\">Direct Studio Line</strong><a href=\"tel:9920086695\" class=\"font-mono text-sm hover:text-[#9d8766] transition-colors font-medium text-[#171513]\">9920086695</a></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-3.5\"><div class=\"p-2 rounded-lg bg-[#ede7dc] text-[#8c795b] shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg></div><div><strong class=\"block text-[#171513] font-medium font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider mb-0.5\">Email Inquiries</strong><a href=\"mailto:interiordesigner@gmail.com\" class=\"hover:text-[#9d8766] transition-colors break-all\">interiordesigner@gmail.com</a></div></div></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-[#ded5c2] grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><a href=\"tel:9920086695\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-[#faf9f6] text-[#171513] border border-[#ded5c2] hover:bg-[#ede7dc] text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-medium transition-all text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#9d8766]\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg><span>Call Us</span></a><a href=\"https://wa.me/919920086695?text=Hello%20KRM%20Interior%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20an%20interior%20project.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-[#171513] text-[#faf9f6] hover:bg-[#38332b] text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-medium transition-all text-center shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#d6caa7]\"><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg><span>WhatsApp</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 bg-[#f5f2ea]/70 p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-[#e5ded0] shadow-sm\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-medium text-[#171513] mb-2\">Start a Conversation</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-[#6e6557] mb-8\">Share details regarding your residence or commercial space. We will respond promptly.</p><form class=\"space-y-5\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5\"><div><label class=\"block text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#696154] mb-2 font-medium\">Your Name *</label><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. Rahul Sharma\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-[#F7F4EE] border-b border-[#d9cfbe] text-xs text-[#171513] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#9d8766]\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#696154] mb-2 font-medium\">Phone Number *</label><input type=\"tel\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. 98200XXXXX\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-[#F7F4EE] border-b border-[#d9cfbe] text-xs text-[#171513] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#9d8766]\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5\"><div><label class=\"block text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#696154] mb-2 font-medium\">Email Address</label><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"e.g. rahul@example.com\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-[#F7F4EE] border-b border-[#d9cfbe] text-xs text-[#171513] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#9d8766]\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#696154] mb-2 font-medium\">Service Requirement</label><select class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-[#F7F4EE] border-b border-[#d9cfbe] text-xs text-[#171513] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#9d8766]\"><option value=\"Residential Interiors\" selected=\"\">Residential Interiors</option><option value=\"Commercial Interiors\">Commercial Interiors</option><option value=\"Living Room Design\">Living Room Design</option><option value=\"Bedroom Design\">Bedroom Design</option><option value=\"Modular Kitchen\">Modular Kitchen</option><option value=\"Office Interiors\">Office Interiors</option><option value=\"Custom Interior Design\">Custom Interior Design</option><option value=\"Complete Interior Solutions\">Complete Interior Solutions</option></select></div></div><div><label class=\"block text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#696154] mb-2 font-medium\">Space Notes / Requirements</label><textarea rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Tell us about the property, location in Mumbai, carpet area, or current condition...\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 bg-[#F7F4EE] border-b border-[#d9cfbe] text-xs text-[#171513] focus:outline-none focus:border-[#9d8766] resize-none\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center space-x-2 py-4 px-6 rounded-xl bg-[#171513] text-[#faf9f6] hover:bg-[#38332b] text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-medium transition-all shadow-md\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#d6caa7]\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg><span>Start a Conversation</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#d6caa7]\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></button><p class=\"text-[11px] text-center font-mono text-[#8a8070]\">Studio located on Dr. B. A. Road, Parel, Mumbai. Visits by prior appointment.</p></form></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"bg-[#181614] text-[#ede7dc] pt-20 pb-12 border-t border-[#2e2a24]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 pb-16 border-b border-[#2e2a24]\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-4\"><img src=\"/_next/static/media/logo.2d18d87f.png\" alt=\"KRM Interior Logo\" class=\"filter invert md:w-[11em] sm:w-[10em] w-[10em] object-contain\"/><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#a89b87] font-mono\">Interior Design • Interior Architecture</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[#a69c8f] max-w-sm leading-relaxed pt-2\">Creating thoughtfully designed residential and commercial spaces across Mumbai. Where architectural balance, bespoke materials, and human rituals align.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-3 space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#d6caa7] font-semibold mb-4\">Navigation</p><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-xs text-[#b8ad9e] hover:text-[#faf9f6] transition-colors\" href=\"#top\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-xs text-[#b8ad9e] hover:text-[#faf9f6] transition-colors\" href=\"#about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"text-xs text-[#b8ad9e] hover:text-[#faf9f6] transition-colors\" href=\"#services\">Services</a></li><li><a class=\"text-xs text-[#b8ad9e] hover:text-[#faf9f6] transition-colors\" href=\"#showcase\">Showcase</a></li><li><a class=\"text-x